§ `ss 5, 13 -- where the Act applies`

#ASSERT `Does the Act apply where I make my declaration` `in a State or a Territory forming part of the Commonwealth`
#ASSERT `Does the Act apply where I make my declaration` `in a foreign country`
#ASSERT `Does the Act apply where I make my declaration` `in Norfolk Island`
#ASSERT `Does the Act apply where I make my declaration` `in an external Territory named in a Proclamation under s 13`
#ASSERT NOT `Does the Act apply where I make my declaration` `in another Territory not forming part of the Commonwealth`

§ `s 6 -- what my declaration may be used for`

#ASSERT `May I make a statutory declaration about any matter` 

#ASSERT `May my declaration be used for this` `for the purposes of a Commonwealth or Territory law` FALSE EQUALS `s 6(2) authorises this use`
#ASSERT `May my declaration be used for this` `for the purposes of a Commonwealth or Territory law` TRUE EQUALS `not authorised: the law shows a contrary intention`
#ASSERT `May my declaration be used for this` `in connection with a matter arising under a Commonwealth or Territory law` TRUE EQUALS `not authorised: the law shows a contrary intention`
#ASSERT `May my declaration be used for this` `in connection with the administration of a Commonwealth Department of State` TRUE EQUALS `s 6(2) authorises this use`
#ASSERT `May my declaration be used for this` `as evidence in a judicial proceeding` FALSE EQUALS `not authorised by s 6(2), but s 6 does not prevent its use as evidence`
#ASSERT `May my declaration be used for this` `for some other purpose, such as a State law or a private matter` FALSE EQUALS `not authorised by s 6(2): this Act neither authorises nor forbids it`

§ `s 7A -- signing`

#ASSERT `Does s 7A recognise my signature` `by hand on a physical form` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT `Does s 7A recognise my signature` `by electronic means on an electronic form` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Does s 7A recognise my signature` `by electronic means on an electronic form` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Does s 7A recognise my signature` `by hand on a physical form` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `Does s 7A recognise my signature` `some other way` TRUE TRUE

§ `ss 8, 9, 9A -- is my declaration made under the Act`

-- d034: the first two are declarations Daniel witnesses.
#ASSERT `Is my declaration made under the Act` `Daniel witnesses a client on paper, in person (d034)` EQUALS `made under s 9: signed under a prescribed person's observation in person`
#ASSERT `Is my declaration made under the Act` `Daniel witnesses by video link and signs a true copy (d034)` EQUALS `made under s 9: signed under a prescribed person's observation by video link`
#ASSERT `Is my declaration made under the Act` `video link, the witness later signs the declaration itself` EQUALS `made under s 9: signed under a prescribed person's observation by video link`
#ASSERT `Is my declaration made under the Act` `in person, the witness signs only a copy` EQUALS `not made under the Act: the witness signed neither the declaration nor, after a video link, a true copy`
#ASSERT `Is my declaration made under the Act` `in person, the witness is not a prescribed person` EQUALS `not made under the Act: the witness is not a prescribed person`
#ASSERT `Is my declaration made under the Act` `not in the approved form` EQUALS `not made under the Act: not in the approved form`
#ASSERT `Is my declaration made under the Act` `signed some other way` EQUALS `not made under the Act: not signed in a way s 7A recognises`
#ASSERT `Is my declaration made under the Act` `online, every s 9A limb met` EQUALS `made under s 9A: digitally verified on an approved online platform`
#ASSERT `Is my declaration made under the Act` `online, on a platform not prescribed` EQUALS `not made under the Act: the platform is not an approved online platform`
#ASSERT `Is my declaration made under the Act` `online, identity verified outside the prescribed conditions` EQUALS `not made under the Act: my identity was not verified as s 9A(1)(b) requires`
#ASSERT `Is my declaration made under the Act` `online, without the prescribed platform information` EQUALS `not made under the Act: it lacks the platform information s 9A(1)(c) requires`
#ASSERT `Is my declaration made under the Act` `signed alone, no witness and no platform` EQUALS `not made under the Act: no witness watched and no online platform was used`

§ `s 9 -- the person asked to witness`

-- d034: Daniel, a prescribed person (ASSUMED input), may witness in person or by video link, not unseen.
#ASSERT `May I witness this declaration` TRUE `I watch the declarant sign in person`
#ASSERT `May I witness this declaration` TRUE `I watch the declarant sign by video link`
#ASSERT NOT `May I witness this declaration` TRUE `I do not watch the declarant sign`
#ASSERT NOT `May I witness this declaration` FALSE `I watch the declarant sign in person`

#ASSERT `What must I sign as the witness` TRUE `I watch the declarant sign in person` EQUALS `the declaration itself`
#ASSERT `What must I sign as the witness` TRUE `I watch the declarant sign by video link` EQUALS `the declaration itself, or a copy I am satisfied is a true copy, with or without the declarant's signature`
#ASSERT `What must I sign as the witness` TRUE `I do not watch the declarant sign` EQUALS `nothing: s 9 needs me to watch the declarant sign`
#ASSERT `What must I sign as the witness` FALSE `I watch the declarant sign by video link` EQUALS `nothing: I am not a prescribed person, so I cannot witness under s 9`

§ `s 9B(1) -- the platform keeps no copy`

#ASSERT NOT `May the platform keep a copy of my declaration` 

§ `s 10 -- a declaration another law says is made before someone`

#ASSERT `Before whom may I make the declaration that law requires` FALSE EQUALS `before the person that law names, or under a prescribed person's observation under s 9`
#ASSERT `Before whom may I make the declaration that law requires` TRUE EQUALS `only before the person that law names: it shows a contrary intention`

§ `s 11 -- a false declaration`

#ASSERT `Do I commit the false declaration offence` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Do I commit the false declaration offence` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Do I commit the false declaration offence` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `Do I commit the false declaration offence` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE

#ASSERT `What is the longest I can be imprisoned for a false declaration in years`  EQUALS 4

